      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you think we could also indicate API level support here? i.e. the API is available starting 34. I mention this specifically because when testing on a API level 33 device, the `VirtualMachineManager` was not null and any subsequent invocations on it didn\u0027t throw an error. Basically it failed silently. Perhaps there\u0027s just a stub on that API version.",
